{"id":"m68816:para:fs-idp118266672","rulings":["temperature"],"maxOps":6,"en":"Describe how energy is redistributed when a spoon at room temperature is placed in a cup of hot coffee.","is":"Lýstu því hvernig orku er endurdreift þegar skeið við stofuhita er sett í bolla af heitu kaffi."},
{"id":"m68816:para:fs-idm37784928","rulings":["heat","thermal-energy"],"maxOps":6,"en":"Heat will spontaneously flow from the hotter object (coffee) to the colder object (spoon), resulting in a more uniform distribution of thermal energy as the spoon warms and the coffee cools.","is":"Varmi mun sjálfkrafa flæða frá heitari hlutnum (kaffinu) yfir í þann kaldari (skeiðina), sem leiðir til jafnari dreifingar varmaorku þegar skeiðin hitnar og kaffið kólnar."},
{"id":"m68816:problem:fs-idm2629152","rulings":["atom"],"maxOps":6,"en":"A helium-filled balloon spontaneously deflates overnight as He atoms diffuse through the wall of the balloon. Describe the redistribution of matter and/or energy that accompanies this process.","is":"Helíumfyllt blaðra tæmist sjálfkrafa yfir nótt þegar He-atóm dreifast í gegnum vegg blöðrunnar. Lýstu endurdreifingu efnis og/eða orku sem fylgir þessu ferli."}
]}

